    {
      "target": "Data/Festivals/fall27",
      "key": "Alex",
      "field": null,
      "source": "There's something weird over there. But how do I get to it?#$e#There's gotta be a secret passage somewhere around here.",
      "translation": "Tamhle je něco divného. Ale jak se k tomu dostanu?#$e#Někde tady přece musí být tajná chodba.",
