    {
      "target": "Data/Festivals/fall27",
      "key": "Lewis",
      "field": null,
      "source": "Good evening, @. Have you ventured into the haunted maze yet? It's quite spooky.#$e#That strange man who lives in the tower set it all up himself. He wouldn't let anyone near while he was working on it.",
      "translation": "Dobrý večer, @. Už máš za sebou cestu strašidelným bludištěm? Je pořádně děsivé.#$e#Ten podivín, který žije ve věži, ho celé postavil sám. Během práce k němu nikoho nepustil.",
      "sourceSHA256": "f32cb929b40723a7be4584e2a616db3874c19a14428798769fbc970c226198ea",
      "translationSHA256": "7e70e94d97a09f45636544d62ce4add85888b53d6707d0e524d9412d65bb2f50",
      "reviewChecks": [
