      "key": "Penny",
      "field": null,
      "source": "The vapor from this cauldron... it's making my head spin, but I can't seem to leave...$u",
      "translation": "Výpary z tohoto kotle... motá se mi z nich hlava, ale nějak nedokážu odejít...$u",
